#### truecolor-80-dark
Usage: tidewater [options] [command]

Options:
  -v, --verbose <level>       Print more while working
  -h, --help                  display help for command

Build:
  build                       Build the project

Commands:
  export                      Export the project
  import                      Import a project
  publish <target> [channel]  Publish the project
  help [command]              display help for command

License:
  activate [key]              Add a license key (prompted, or piped on stdin)
  status                      Show your license, devices and offline time
  deactivate                  Stop using your license on this device and make
                              room for another
  login                       Sign in with your account in the browser
  logout                      Sign out on this device
  devices list                List the devices using your license
  devices rename <deviceId> [label...]
                              Rename a device (no name clears it)
  devices deauthorize <deviceId>
                              Remove a device and make room for another
  update check                Check for a newer version
  update apply                Download and install the newer version

